<title>USA: Union Tank Car Co issues $150 million in debt.</title>
<headline>Union Tank Car Co issues $150 million in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Union Tank Car Co was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>Chicago, Illinois-based Union Tank Car, a wholly-owned private subsidiary of Marmon Industrial Corp, is a builder and lessor of railroad tank cars.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNION TANK CAR CO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.45 PCT   MATURITY 6/01/2009</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 7.45 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 68 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
